Z||000000||Jaei Sun||05-23-2000||03:08 PM||||I'm new to this particular board. And right now I'm currently looking for an 86-88 to do that fantastic Fino rebody... I've ripped through the internet looking for information on this body and have come up only with scraps. Has anyone here done this particular body on one of their cars or know someone that has? And I agree with some of the others... I don't care too much for the Ferarri or Lambo kits... they're just fakes... but the Fino (and Finale) doesn't try to be a car it's not... that's why I like it. I'd love to have a car that has more style than todays generic cars... and when it's on the street I want people to say "What the F*** is that???!"<BR>||||reg||14
